<title>USA: Indonesia Telkom at 26-3/8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom at 26-3/8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 26-3/8 in New York on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of 25-15/16 and the day's high of 26-5/8.</p>
<p>Volume was 149,500 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 59,000. It previous close on Wednesday was 27-1/4. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
